              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy Inconel® 625 | UNS# N06250 is a nickel based super-alloy that demonstrates high strength properties, is resistant to high temperatures, has remarkable protection against oxidation and corrosion. Nickel Alloy Inconel® 625 shows the ability to withstand high stress environments and has excellent fabricability. Due to these properties, Nickel Alloy Inconel® 625 is widely used for sea-water applications because of high corrosion-fatigue strength, high tensile strength, and excellent resistance to chloride chemicals. Often used in propeller blades, propulsion motors, fittings for submersibles, oceanographic instrumentation and many other applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy Inconel® 625 Inventory Size Range:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Round Bar (diameter): 0.250″/6.35 mm – 14.000″/355.6 mm"
                },
